@AGENTS.md

## Claude Code

Pipeline: `/spec <slice or ticket>` → read the spec → `/build <stem>`. Plans
may also come from OpenCode's `/plan`; hand them over with `/spec <stem>`.
The record lives in `.handoff/` and is shared with OpenCode — read it, never
rewrite an earlier document.

Match the model to the spec's tier (your call, `/model` to switch):
T1 → Sonnet · T2 → Sonnet at high effort, or Opus · T3 → Opus. At T3 keep
edits on manual approval; do not switch to accept-edits.

Reads that would pull many files into this session go to the `Explore`
subagent (it is pinned to a cheap model in `~/.claude/agents/Explore.md`).
